  <!-- Large Goblin, dangerous in melee, large sized, high metabolism -->
  <XenotypeDef>
    <defName>MSSG_Hobgoblin</defName>
    <label>Hobgoblin</label>
    <description>Hobgoblins are the rarely seen large-bodied goblins that have somehow survived long enough to be considered middle-aged. Hobgoblins are dangerous, and rule over the entire Goblin tunnel. Rumours have been whispered by old hooded men in even older kingdoms that Hobgoblins may grow into an even larger form still.</description>
    <descriptionShort>Hobgoblins are the huge, dangerous goblins in charge of Goblin society.</descriptionShort>
